ions. While AWS Shield Standard helps protect all AWS customers, you get be=
tter protection if you are using Amazon CloudFront and Amazon Route 53. All=
 AWS customers benefit from the automatic protections of AWS Shield Standar=
d, at no additional charge.</p>

