<p>According to the AWS Shared Responsibility Model, AWS is responsible for=
 "Security of the Cloud". This includes protecting the infrastructure that =
runs all of the services offered in the AWS Cloud. This infrastructure is c=
omposed of the hardware, software, networking, and facilities that run AWS =
Cloud services.</p>

<p><strong>Replacing faulty hardware of Amazon EC2 instances</strong> - Rep=
lacing faulty hardware of Amazon EC2 instances comes under the infrastructu=
re maintenance "of" the cloud. This is the responsibility of AWS.</p>

<p><strong>Operating the infrastructure layer, the operating system and the=
 platform for the Amazon S3 service</strong> - For abstracted services, suc=
h as Amazon S3 and Amazon DynamoDB, AWS operates the infrastructure layer, =
the operating system, and platforms, and customers access the endpoints to =
store and retrieve data.</p>

<p>Shared Responsibility Model Overview:
